{"name": "BOTCLOPS", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready for total chaos, teamwork, and a bunch of explosions! BOTCLOPS is a 2-4 player co-op puzzle game where quick thinking and good communication are key to survival. Work with your friends to avoid hazards, outsmart quirky robots, and beat every tower.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WORK TOGETHER:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"210\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134420/extras/650cd53f3c131038774e7ef3b376dc5c.poster.avif?t=1791313986\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134420/extras/650cd53f3c131038774e7ef3b376dc5c.webm?t=1791313986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134420/extras/650cd53f3c131038774e7ef3b376dc5c.mp4?t=1791313986\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cooperate with your friends using proximity voice chat, build bridges and stairs with your blocks, step on moving platforms as a team to activate them, and get everyone into the elevator to beat the level.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLOSIONS:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"210\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134420/extras/299930483e4b124cb1339dc1c71f392c.poster.avif?t=1791313986\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134420/extras/299930483e4b124cb1339dc1c71f392c.webm?t=1791313986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134420/extras/299930483e4b124cb1339dc1c71f392c.mp4?t=1791313986\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Warning! Everything in BOTCLOPS explodes! Breakable blocks? Boom. Strange robots? Boom. Your Friends? Boom. Your block if you die while it's placed? Boom. Even unlocking the exit lock triggers an explosion!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MECHANICS:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"210\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134420/extras/f02db211496ec6e4cff3866327d0377e.poster.avif?t=1791313986\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134420/extras/f02db211496ec6e4cff3866327d0377e.webm?t=1791313986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134420/extras/f02db211496ec6e4cff3866327d0377e.mp4?t=1791313986\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blocks are just the beginning! You and your friends will run into strange new robots with unique mechanics that you'll need to figure out together to beat each level.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GET THE KEY:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"210\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134420/extras/2666fc277735e91ac9559d60c3f2d6d2.poster.avif?t=1791313986\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134420/extras/2666fc277735e91ac9559d60c3f2d6d2.webm?t=1791313986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134420/extras/2666fc277735e91ac9559d60c3f2d6d2.mp4?t=1791313986\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal is clear: find the key, unlock the exit elevator, and move on to the next level. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>OTHER FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Server Browser:\u00a0</strong>Public, Passcode, and Invite-Only games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Proximity Voice Chat:</strong> Coordinate with your friends.</p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "BOTCLOPS is an explosive 2-4 player co-op action puzzle game! Encounter various strange one-eyed robots, and use blocks to solve and survive 28 unique levels.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134420/4830b179e91602000616bf4033fc325cb3a337de/header.jpg?t=1791313986", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Multiplayer", "Online Co-Op", "Co-op", "Puzzle Platformer", "Cute", "Platformer"], "developers": "KytanDev", "publishers": "KytanDev", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4134420", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "6 October 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/pqkks1RkmQM", "first_seen": 1791237600.0, "review_rank": 5}